# WP-STREAM-SETTINGS (owner 11-17 "WP to the end", tail AUDIT-WP-1104): the streaming settings come from the project's
# Config/Engine.json section "WorldPartition" (Config/Mac|Windows/Engine.json over it), read as Play begins;
# BlockOnSlowStreaming decides whether a missing cell under the player stops the game behind the loading overlay.
# World: Scenes/WP_Protocol (WP-PROTOCOL.scn). Source: the Player 9000001, moved 2 km at once by its shape offset.
# The project layer is written by the Project Settings palette entries: Block On Slow Streaming off and Max
# Concurrent Loads 1 for Play 1, Block On Slow Streaming on for Play 2, the defaults (on, 4) back at the end.
# The source jumps ~400 m, into the middle of Main cell (-15,2) (X -37500..-35000, Z 5000..7500): a planned cell beyond
# the 200 m range of where Play starts, so it is not resident when the source lands in it. WP_Protocol's cells are sparse,
# and a jump onto a stretch no planned cell covers never blocks (WorldPartitionStreamingPerformance.hpp: nothing to wait
# for) - the earlier target x -25000, z 5000 was such a stretch.
# Expected (editor.log): Play 1 - "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': slow streaming (blocking disabled)" once, no
# "play waits"; Play 2 - "play waits for it", then "play resumes".
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,0,0
Дано run "Project Settings" "World Partition: Block On Slow Streaming off"
Дано run "Project Settings" "World Partition: Max Concurrent Loads 1"
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Когда select 9000001
Когда --subject selection set Translation -36250,200,6250
Когда advance 1
Тогда wpset_noblock BlockOnSlowStreaming=false: оверлея загрузки нет, под игроком в 400 м HLOD или пустая земля; лог «slow streaming (blocking disabled)», нет «play waits»
Когда run Action "Stop"
Дано run "Project Settings" "World Partition: Block On Slow Streaming on"
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,0,0
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Когда select 9000001
Когда --subject selection set Translation -36250,200,6250
# Frames, not seconds: while play waits the game clock stops, so "advance" would answer only after the block lifted.
Когда frames 3
Тогда wpset_block BlockOnSlowStreaming=true: оверлей загрузки поверх кадра; лог «play waits for it»
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Тогда wpset_block_loaded ячейка под игроком загружена (настоящая, не HLOD), оверлей снят; лог «play resumes»
Когда run Action "Stop"
Когда run "Project Settings" "World Partition: Max Concurrent Loads 4"
